    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mountain and The Moron is a 3D Rage Platformer about a Uncle who is down on his luck, and watches a podcast telling him to &quot;Climb a mountain to become Enlightened&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/3a8835373efea0b8d0907151785ed0a4.avif?t=1755686788\" width=666 height=375 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Located near the city of Uncleville, Mount Onkle, a previous attraction for the city. After years of neglect, the mountain's platforms are falling apart, making the mountain very dangerous. It has yet to claim a life, so don't be the first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/db139c4e89c192fcc1f1c652a53caf0a.avif?t=1755686788\" width=267 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Uncle Dagobert, a local Uncle with no climbing experience. You will try and fail to reach the top of the mountain. You are &quot;assisted&quot; by other strange characters who watch and record you trying to reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--FEATURES</strong>--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 challenging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of game modifiers that change up you experience in fun and unique ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdolls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret codes that add fun Easter eggs to the game<br>Difficult platforming in risky spots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built in timer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made a student project :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-RasberryPi</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mountain and The Moron is a 3D Rage Platformer about a Uncle who is down on his luck, and watches a podcast telling him to &quot;Climb a mountain to become Enlightened&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/3a8835373efea0b8d0907151785ed0a4.avif?t=1755686788\" width=666 height=375 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Located near the city of Uncleville, Mount Onkle, a previous attraction for the city. After years of neglect, the mountain's platforms are falling apart, making the mountain very dangerous. It has yet to claim a life, so don't be the first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/db139c4e89c192fcc1f1c652a53caf0a.avif?t=1755686788\" width=267 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Uncle Dagobert, a local Uncle with no climbing experience. You will try and fail to reach the top of the mountain. You are &quot;assisted&quot; by other strange characters who watch and record you trying to reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--FEATURES</strong>--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 challenging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of game modifiers that change up you experience in fun and unique ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdolls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret codes that add fun Easter eggs to the game<br>Difficult platforming in risky spots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built in timer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made a student project :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-RasberryPi</p>",
